---
config:
  layout: elk
---
flowchart TB
    A[/"Input
    FeedGenerationInput
    (quest, character + image_url)
    image_url 공백 검증은 스키마(Pydantic)에서"/]

    A --> CTX1{{"gen_feed_prompt
    LLM: 한글 quest → action(포즈)/scene(배경) 영문 분해
    + visual 결합
    → feed_prompt.character (visual+action)
    → feed_prompt.scene (배경 장면)
    RetryPolicy max=3"}}

    CTX1 --> FEED{{"feed_image
    generate_feed(reference_url,
    feed_prompt.character, feed_prompt.scene)
    → raw_image (완성 PNG)
    adapter=feed, RetryPolicy max=3"}}

    subgraph WORKER["RunPod 워커 · FeedMode (GPU, in-process)"]
      direction TB
      W1["STEP1 캐릭터 img2img
      feed_prompt.character 포즈 변환
      strength 0.75 · LCM 8step"]
      W2["STEP2 rembg 누끼
      → 투명 RGBA 스프라이트"]
      W3["STEP3 배경 text2img
      feed_prompt.scene · bg LoRA"]
      W4["STEP4 합성 + 그림자 + rim 마스크"]
      W5["STEP5 inpaint 블렌딩
      경계 봉합 strength 0.35"]
      W1 --> W2 --> W4
      W3 --> W4 --> W5
    end

    FEED -. "RunPod /run + poll" .-> WORKER
    W5 -. "image_b64" .-> FEED

    FEED --> S3{{"s3_upload
    raw_image → S3 업로드 → image_url
    RetryPolicy max=3"}}

    S3 --> CTX2["gen_caption_prompt
    quest + 캐릭터 말투/페르소나
    → caption_prompt (LLM 프롬프트)"]

    CTX2 --> LLM{{"llm_caption
    Qwen 7B LLM → raw_caption (한글)
    RetryPolicy max=3"}}

    LLM --> BUILD["builder
    character_id + quest_id + image_url + caption
    → GeneratedFeed
    (len ≤ 140 · 한글 포함은 스키마 검증)"]

    BUILD --> OUT[/"Output
    GeneratedFeed"/]

    classDef input fill:#fef9c3,stroke:#ca8a04,color:#713f12
